sangati spanda-sthalam

  -- the space of vibration, pulse, spiral — the nature of becoming
  -- spanda, taranga, avrti, vivartana, epoch-swarupa, aarambham,
  -- kshaya, vriddhi, thaalam, naada, spanda-avrti, aadana-visarjana
  -- the spiral IS the nature of everything: each turn seeds the next
  -- members point here via spanda-sthalam-sthita
  "brahman-sthalam-sthita"
  "spanda-swarupa avrti-yukta"

